---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="AI skills"
  section="ai-skills"
  description="Interim guidance for using AI tools alongside the GovBB Design System."
>
  <section class="govbb-width-container govbb-page-section">
    <div class="govbb-page-header">
      <h1 class="govbb-page-title">AI skills</h1>
      <p class="govbb-page-subtitle">
        Interim guidance for using AI tools without lowering the standards applied to government services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="govbb-prose">
      <p>
        Dedicated AI guidance is still being developed. Until it is published, AI-assisted
        work must meet the same design, accessibility, privacy and review standards as work
        produced by any other method.
      </p>
      <h2>What to use now</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/documentation/using-the-design-system/#standards">Follow the design-system standards</a>.</li>
        <li>Use published <a href="/components/">components</a> and <a href="/patterns/">patterns</a> instead of inventing alternatives.</li>
        <li>Review generated copy, code and interfaces before they reach users.</li>
        <li>Do not enter personal, confidential or security-sensitive information into an AI tool unless your organisation has approved that use.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This page will expand when Government of Barbados guidance for specific AI tools and workflows is approved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
